{
  "mn5:0.1": "Majjhima Nikāya 5 ",
  "mn5:0.2": "Anaṅgaṇasutta ",
  "mn5:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "mn5:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā sāvatthiyaṁ viharati jetavane anāthapiṇḍikassa ārāme. ",
  "mn5:1.3": "Tatra kho āyasmā sāriputto bhikkhū āmantesi: ",
  "mn5:1.4": "“āvuso bhikkhave”ti. ",
  "mn5:1.5": "“Āvuso”ti kho te bhikkhū āyasmato sāriputtassa paccassosuṁ. ",
  "mn5:1.6": "Āyasmā sāriputto etadavoca: ",
  "mn5:2.1": "“Cattārome, āvuso, puggalā santo saṁvijjamānā lokasmiṁ. ",
  "mn5:2.2": "Katame cattāro? ",
  "mn5:2.3": "Idhāvuso, ekacco puggalo sāṅgaṇova samāno ‘atthi me ajjhattaṁ aṅgaṇan’ti yathābhūtaṁ nappajānāti. ",
  "mn5:2.4": "Idha panāvuso, ekacco puggalo sāṅgaṇova samāno ‘atthi me ajjhattaṁ aṅgaṇan’ti yathābhūtaṁ pajānāti. ",
  "mn5:2.5": "Idhāvuso, ekacco puggalo anaṅgaṇova samāno ‘natthi me ajjhattaṁ aṅgaṇan’ti yathābhūtaṁ nappajānāti. ",
  "mn5:2.6": "Idha panāvuso, ekacco puggalo anaṅgaṇova samāno ‘natthi me ajjhattaṁ aṅgaṇan’ti yathābhūtaṁ pajānāti. ",
  "mn5:2.7": "Tatrāvuso, yvāyaṁ puggalo sāṅgaṇova samāno ‘atthi me ajjhattaṁ aṅgaṇan’ti yathābhūtaṁ nappajānāti, ayaṁ imesaṁ dvinnaṁ puggalānaṁ sāṅgaṇānaṁyeva sataṁ hīnapuriso akkhāyati. ",
  "mn5:2.8": "Tatrāvuso, yvāyaṁ puggalo sāṅgaṇova samāno ‘atthi me ajjhattaṁ aṅgaṇan’ti yathābhūtaṁ pajānāti, ayaṁ imesaṁ dvinnaṁ